{"id":"vod_lz_58128","vodId":"58128","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修第一季","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修第一季","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230419-1/043427d5a8988254cc498878144f693c.jpg"},"summary":"　　鲁路修本是帝国的王子，在母后遇害后，和失明的妹妹一起被流放到11区（原日本国）作为人质。在那里他们结识了日本王子朱雀，三人共同度过一段美好的童年时光。帝国最终全面攻陷了11区，鲁路修和妹妹的安宁生活再次被剥夺，朱雀和他们也分散了。　　鲁路修和妹妹隐瞒身份，过着看似平凡的学生生活。然而鲁路修心中对于帝国的仇恨却未停止。他希望摧毁帝国，为妹妹营造一个可以快乐生活的世界。这一切随着神秘少女C.C的出现变得不再遥不可及。　　此时朱雀也再次出现在他们的生活中，然而残酷的现实让童年的挚友难以重温童年往事。这里没有正义和邪恶，黑暗与光明，有的仅仅是艰难的抉择和难以预料的明天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"科幻,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-19 15:55:37","classic":true,"classicRank":16,"franchise":"Code Geass","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8734_97b079a8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8739_116e4d06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8740_6dc9f264/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8737_3c0ac50e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8738_d86ab2bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8745_baf8793d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8743_f21d61d8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8742_2db6e26c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8741_5fe3042e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8744_d08e380d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8746_fdcbe6ac/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8747_8acb5b1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8748_a62828e2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230418/8